/25 sm:text-[96px]">“</span><div class="min-h-[136px] font-serif text-[22px] leading-[1.55] text-foreground sm:min-h-[156px] sm:text-[26px] sm:leading-[1.5]"><p class="m-0"><span>“This is a terrorist attack on America”</span></p><p class="mt-5"><em></em><em>Received telepathically from what sounded like a voice from a middle eastern male.</em></p><p class="mt-5"><span>Someone claimed to be from the Saudi Royal Family and that they were responsible for a terrorist attack on the United States of America.</span></p><p class="mt-5"><span>Additional information was suggested telepathically that the CIA is also attempting to claim responsibility for telepathic phenomena of communication</span></p></div></blockquote><div class="mt-7 border-l-2 border-accent pl-5 sm:ml-16"><p class="m-0 font-display text-[15px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Open question</p><p class="m-0 mt-2 font-display text-[19px] leading-[1.45] text-foreground/90 sm:text-[21px]">Was this really the Saudi Royal Family, or someone from the Zersetzung disintegration-tactics community claiming to be from the Saudi Royal Family?</p></div><figcaption class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 pt-7 pl-7 text-[17px] sm:pl-16"><a href="/journal/is-j01-20250227-entry" class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4">Read this entry</a></figcaption></figure></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 pl-4 basis-full"><figure class="m-0 flex min-h-[260px] flex-col sm:min-h-[280px]"><p class="m-0 font-display text-[16px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Thursday, May 29, 2025</p><blockquote class="relative m-0 mt-7 pl-7 sm:pl-16"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-serif absolute left-0 top-[-0.2em] select-none text-[44px] leading-none text-foreground/25 sm:text-[96px]">“</span><div class="min-h-[136px] font-serif text-[22px] leading-[1.55] text-foreground sm:min-h-[156px] sm:text-[26px] sm:leading-[1.5]"><p class="m-0"><span>“I’m so glad you started typing.” *</span><em>Male #?</em></p><p class="mt-5"><span>“Have you seen this? Have you seen this? Something is going on out there and the Denver Post has to help this person. I am fucking losing it at seeing this person write what I say.”</span></p><p class="mt-5"><span>“Stop typing what we say!... How are we supposed to torment the community if someone is typing it? I feel horrible! I feel fucking horrible doing this to innocent people!”</span></p></div></blockquote><div class="mt-7 border-l-2 border-accent pl-5 sm:ml-16"><p class="m-0 font-display text-[15px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Open question</p><p class="m-0 mt-2 font-display text-[19px] leading-[1.45] text-foreground/90 sm:text-[21px]">Is this remorse from someone taking part, or something performed for the person typing it?</p></div><figcaption class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 pt-7 pl-7 text-[17px] sm:pl-16"><a href="/journal/is-j01-20250529-entry" class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4">Read this entry</a></figcaption></figure></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 pl-4 basis-full"><figure class="m-0 flex min-h-[260px] flex-col sm:min-h-[280px]"><p class="m-0 font-display text-[16px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Thursday, November 6, 2025</p><blockquote class="relative m-0 mt-7 pl-7 sm:pl-16"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-serif absolute left-0 top-[-0.2em] select-none text-[44px] leading-none text-foreground/25 sm:text-[96px]">“</span><div class="min-h-[136px] font-serif text-[22px] leading-[1.55] text-foreground sm:min-h-[156px] sm:text-[26px] sm:leading-[1.5]"><p class="m-0"><span>“Possible use of voice filters. Voice filters is what he calls our voice system. Unbelievable! I’m a female. You’re typing exactly what I’m saying. I’m using a translation tool and I am absolutely certain of this document&#x27;s accuracy. That is exactly what I was thinking as you were typing it. Can you zoom in a little?”</span></p></div></blockquote><div class="mt-7 border-l-2 border-accent pl-5 sm:ml-16"><p class="m-0 font-display text-[15px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Open question</p><p class="m-0 mt-2 font-display text-[19px] leading-[1.45] text-foreground/90 sm:text-[21px]">What would explain a request to zoom in, if nobody could see the screen?</p></div><figcaption class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 pt-7 pl-7 text-[17px] sm:pl-16"><a href="/journal/is-j03-20251106-entry" class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4">Read this entry</a></figcaption></figure></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 pl-4 basis-full"><figure class="m-0 flex min-h-[260px] flex-col sm:min-h-[280px]"><p class="m-0 font-display text-[16px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Sunday, September 28, 2025<!-- --> · audio</p><blockquote class="relative m-0 mt-7 pl-7 sm:pl-16"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-serif absolute left-0 top-[-0.2em] select-none text-[44px] leading-none text-foreground/25 sm:text-[96px]">“</span><div class="min-h-[136px] font-serif text-[22px] leading-[1.55] text-foreground sm:min-h-[156px] sm:text-[26px] sm:leading-[1.5]"><p class="m-0"><span>&quot;Thank you for your service for anyone that&#x27;s shown up.&quot;
&quot;That was the last part I wanted to get to.&quot;
&quot;Um, I refuse to believe that America is doing this to itself, and I refuse to believe that the law enforcement community and any context, any intelligence or law enforcement community would invite the mother of all police brutality events.&quot;</span></p></div></blockquote><div class="mt-7 border-l-2 border-accent pl-5 sm:ml-16"><p class="m-0 font-display text-[15px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Open question</p><p class="m-0 mt-2 font-display text-[19px] leading-[1.45] text-foreground/90 sm:text-[21px]">If not law enforcement, then who — and who would answer for it?</p></div><figcaption class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 pt-7 pl-7 text-[17px] sm:pl-16"><a href="/journal/is-j02-20250928-r05" class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4">Read this entry</a></figcaption></figure></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 pl-4 basis-full"><figure class="m-0 flex min-h-[260px] flex-col sm:min-h-[280px]"><p class="m-0 font-display text-[16px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Saturday, August 23, 2025<!-- --> · audio</p><blockquote class="relative m-0 mt-7 pl-7 sm:pl-16"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-serif absolute left-0 top-[-0.2em] select-none text-[44px] leading-none text-foreground/25 sm:text-[96px]">“</span><div class="min-h-[136px] font-serif text-[22px] leading-[1.55] text-foreground sm:min-h-[156px] sm:text-[26px] sm:leading-[1.5]"><p class="m-0"><span>&quot;And I I think the future we might be looking at, if you imagine this with me for a moment, is everyone opts into this crime preventative layer of transparency and we&#x27;re treated decently.&quot;</span></p><p class="mt-5"><span>&quot;The ethical standards are there, the consent is there.&quot;</span></p></div></blockquote><div class="mt-7 border-l-2 border-accent pl-5 sm:ml-16"><p class="m-0 font-display text-[15px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Open question</p><p class="m-0 mt-2 font-display t